WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.715
In 1841, the tithe survey of Llandough,

2
00:00:03.765 --> 00:00:09.317
Cogan and Leckwith lists thirty-six parcels against John Williams, as occupier.

3
00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:11.656
About a hundred and twenty acres.

4
00:00:11.706 --> 00:00:13.500
