7
00:00:17.662 --> 00:00:21.016
and the 1841 tithe map that carries the numbers.

8
00:00:21.066 --> 00:00:24.632
Then the same ground on the map of Llandough today.

9
00:00:24.682 --> 00:00:29.028
Each field was matched from the tithe map onto the modern map,

10
00:00:29.078 --> 00:00:31.226
